'''Tank Cat''' is one of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] and the second Cat the player obtains as a unit. It is unlocked after clearing [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 and costs 0 XP (500 in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|BCU!]]) or a [[Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsule]] to unlock. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] increases health and attack power.

